25-02-21 at07:30, a calibrated digital instrument (calibration check2024-12-15, uncertainty±0.2C) measured the living room at15.8C after overnight normal operation. Main living rooms stayed15.5–16.3C in the seven-day logger record. Resets restore heat briefly; the pump cuts out repeatedly. The fixed circulation pump has an internal bearing/control failure; it is part of landlord-maintained equipment, outside ordinary small tenant maintenance. Normal ventilation and unobstructed radiators were observed; no tenant alteration or misuse explains the failure.&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;a5e40553523e2dcee2df0f7f1acf40f8743fd93ff0260cf81ee3004ff78e8e1c&quot;,&quot;start_char&quot;:199,&quot;text_sha256&quot;:&quot;a5e40553523e2dcee2df0f7f1acf40f8743fd93ff0260cf81ee3004ff78e8e1c&quot;}\">Source evidence · 02-heating-service-observation.txt</button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-secondary\" data-au-detail=\"documents\">All recorded requirements</button></aside><svg class=\"au-forming-connections\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-au-wire-fact=\"fact:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-wire-source=\"src_000ccf161644df9e82d29a8595b7b727\" data-au-wire-node=\"dh_evidence\" data-au-wire-obligation=\"obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" viewBox=\"0 0 1352 674.078125\"><path data-au-forming-wire=\"source-process\" data-au-wire-fact=\"fact:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-wire-source=\"src_000ccf161644df9e82d29a8595b7b727\" data-au-wire-node=\"dh_evidence\" data-au-wire-obligation=\"obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" d=\"M280 269.46875 C334.5 269.46875,334.5 301.1875,389 301.1875\"></path><path data-au-forming-wire=\"process-document\" data-au-wire-fact=\"fact:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-wire-source=\"src_000ccf161644df9e82d29a8595b7b727\" data-au-wire-node=\"dh_evidence\" data-au-wire-obligation=\"obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" d=\"M396 308.1875 L396 337.1875 L1084.5 337.1875 L1084.5 383.16406